  "text": "Veterinary Referral Associates | Gaithersburg Animal Hospital\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu\nAbout\nOur Hospital\nWhy Trust Us?\nAccreditations & Certifications\nOur Vets\nOur Partnerships\nSpecialty\nCardiology\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nRadiology\nSurgery\nDiagnostics & Lab\nFeline Hyperthyroid Treatment\nVeterinary Sports Medicine\nPhysical Rehabilitation\nAnesthesiology\nSynovetin OA\n®\nCritical Care\nEmergency\nPatients\nPatient Information\nBlood Bank & Donor Program\nPhysiotec Home Exercise Program\nNews & Stories\nFinancing Options\nReferrals\nCareers\nContact\nSearch\nSearch\nFacebook\nInstagram\n×\nClose\nSearch\nSearch\nSkip to Main Content\nAccessible Version\nStandard Version\nFacebook\nInstagram\n500 Perry Pkwy\nGaithersburg\nMD\n20877\nUS\n(301) 926-3300\nShop\nEmergencies\nAbout\nOur Hospital\nWhy Trust Us?\nAccreditations & Certifications\nOur Vets\nOur Partnerships\nSpecialty\nCardiology\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nRadiology\nSurgery\nDiagnostics & Lab\nFeline Hyperthyroid Treatment\nVeterinary Sports Medicine\nPhysical Rehabilitation\nAnesthesiology\nSynovetin OA\n®\nCritical Care\nEmergency\nPatients\nPatient Information\nBlood Bank & Donor Program\nPhysiotec Home Exercise Program\nNews & Stories\nFinancing Options\nReferrals\nCareers\nContact\nRequest Appointment\nOpen Search Dialog\nOpen 7 Days a Week, Including Saturdays & Sundays\nOpen 7 Days a Week\nAt Veterinary Referral Associates, we offer all the specialty veterinary services needed for emergencies. Our vets provide compassionate care 24/7, including Saturdays and Sundays.\nNEW PATIENTS ALWAYS WELCOME!\nCall\n(301) 926-3300\nOpen 7 Days a Week\nAt Veterinary Referral Associates, we offer all the specialty veterinary services needed for emergencies. Our vets provide compassionate care 24/7, including Saturdays and Sundays.\nNEW PATIENTS ALWAYS WELCOME!\nCall\n(301) 926-3300\nOpen 7 Days a Week\nAt Veterinary Referral Associates, we offer all the specialty veterinary services needed for emergencies. Our vets provide compassionate care 24/7, including Saturdays and Sundays.\nNEW PATIENTS ALWAYS WELCOME!\nCall\n(301) 926-3300\nSurgical Procedures To Restore Pet Health\nOur surgical center at\nVeterinary Referral Associates\nin Gaithersburg is a cutting-edge facility staffed by veterinary surgery experts.\nLearn More\nEmergency Care When Your Pet Needs It Most\nOur dedicated vets and critical care specialists are trained in emergency medicine and triage and provide quality, compassionate care 24 hours, 7 days a week.\nLearn More\nSpecialized Internal Medicine Treatments\nOur veterinary internal medicine specialists in Gaithersburg provide specially-designed care for sick pets referred to us by their primary veterinarians.\nLearn More\nAdvanced Diagnostic Technologies and Tools\nOur Gaithersburg vets use diagnostic tests and tools to diagnose your pet's medical conditions and create custom treatment plans.\nLearn More\nOur Veterinarians in Gaithersburg Welcome Patients 7 Days A Week, Including Saturdays & Sundays\nVeterinary Referral Associates\nis a full-service pet hospital in Gaithersburg and the surrounding areas. We provide comprehensive medical services for cats and dogs.\nFrom\ninternal medicine\nand\nsurgery\nto\nphysical therapy\nand\nSynovetin OA\n®\ntreatments, our broad and varied service offering can meet all of your pet’s health needs in one place.\nWe look after the companion animals of Gaithersburg. We have earned a reputation for providing high-quality care with a compassionate touch over the years.\nOur team of Gaithersburg vets proudly uphold the AAHA's veterinary excellence standards!\nComprehensive care for your precious pets.\nFeline Hyperthyroid Treatment\nRadioactive Iodine Therapy for cats diagnosed with hyperthyroidism.\nLearn More\nPhysical Rehabilitation\nCustom programs for your pet that incorporate both treatment and physical therapy.\nLearn More\nNeurology\nDiagnosis and treatment of disorders of the brain, spinal cord, muscles, and nerves of animals.\nLearn More\nOncology\nDiagnosis and treatment to provide pets with cancer the best possible care.\nLearn More\nOphthalmology\nDiagnosing and treating eye diseases and disorders in cats and dogs.\nLearn More\nBlood Bank Services\nBlood donation program to help save countless furry lives!\nLearn More\nAccreditations & Certifications\nYour pet can help as part of our Blood Donor Program.\nLearn More\nOpen 24/7 for Emergency Care\nVeterinary Referral Associates\nproudly serves patients in Gaithersburg and beyond. Specialty appointments may be available by schedule, including select weekend availability.\nHospital Hours\nMonday:\n24 hours\nTuesday:\n24 hours\nWednesday:\n24 hours\nThursday:\n24 hours\nFriday:\n24 hours\nSaturday:\n24 hours\nSunday:\n24 hours\nPhone\n(301) 926-3300\nAddress\n500 Perry Pkwy\nGaithersburg\nMD\n20877\nUS\nContact Us\nTips & Advice From Our Team\nOur informative blogs feature helpful tips and advice from our Gaithersburg vets. They keep your pets healthy and happy, whether need advice on parasite protection or information on common illnesses.\nThe Best Dog Breeds for Kids\nAre you seeking a great canine companion for your kids? Here are the best small and large dog breeds that are great for kids and their families, as recommended by our Gaithersburg vets.\nRead more\nAnxiety & Depression in Dogs: Causes, Signs & What to Do\nJust like us, our canine friends can experience depression and anxiety. While your dog's symptoms may indicate one of these conditions, you can help your dog feel better. In today's post, our Gaithersburg vets share some advice for cheering up and calming down your dog.\nRead more\nIs Your Cat Overweight? Signs, Symptoms & What to Do\nWhile it may not seem like a big deal if your feline companion is carrying a few extra pounds, even a slight excess of weight can negatively affect your kitty's long-term health. Here, our Gaithersburg vets list signs that may indicate your cat is overweight.\nRead more\nSpecialty Referrals & 24/7 Emergency Care\nOur specialty services are available by veterinary referral, and our team is here 24 hours a day, 7 days a week to provide urgent and emergency care when your pet needs it most. Contact us to learn more.\nContact Us\nLocation\nVeterinary Referral Associates\n500 Perry Pkwy\nGaithersburg\nMD\n20877\nUS\nPhone Number\n(301) 926-3300\nContact\nSend us a message online.\nHome\nAbout\nSpecialty\nEmergency\nPatients\nReferrals\nCareers\nPrivacy Policy\nDo Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\nTerms & Conditions\nAccessibility\nSearch\nSitemap\nBack to Top\nFacebook\nInstagram\nCopyright © 2026. All Rights Reserved.\nPart of the\nPetVet Care Centers Network\n.\nContact\nCall\n(301) 926-3300\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu",
